  "title": "Himalaya Shipping Ltd. (HSHP) – Commercial Update and Key Information Relating to the Cash Distribution for July 2026",
  "summary": "Hamilton, Bermuda, August 11, 2026 Commercial update: In July 2026, Himalaya Shipping Ltd. (“Himalaya,” or the “Company”) achieved average time charter equivalent (“TCE”) earnings of approximately US$51,200 per day, gross[1], including average daily scrubber benefits of approximately US$2,100 per day. All twelve vessels in our fleet are trading on index-linked time charters in July. The […]",
